blog.section.0=First time seeing me like this, <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">juh</span><span class\="corrected">huh</span></span>?<br>\nWell, some of you probably know me already.<br>\nI <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jad</span><span class\="corrected">had</span></span> Syeria draw the illustration.<br>\nI don't like <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">javing</span><span class\="corrected">having</span></span> my <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">foto</span><span class\="corrected">photo</span></span> taken.<br>\nMy name's Rittsu Albalus.<br>\nThat's Mei next to me. You've probably seen <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jer</span><span class\="corrected">her</span></span> in <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">fotos</span><span class\="corrected">photos</span></span>.<br>\nWhat do I usually do?<br>\nMostly draw symbols and stuff.<br>\nI also look for Ai and <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jelp</span><span class\="corrected">help</span></span> keep them safe, I guess.
blog.section.1=Some of you are probably wondering why Mei's with me.<br>\nWell, a lot <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jappened</span><span class\="corrected">happened</span></span>.<br>\nIt started back in 2040. I was living alone then.<br>\nMy parents <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jad</span><span class\="corrected">had</span></span> been debugged in 2038. My father, Ritaren, was the first to <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jold</span><span class\="corrected">hold</span></span> the title Artist R.
blog.section.2=On September 31, 2040, I found a little Warwolf sleeping alone in the park.<br>\nShe looked <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jungry</span><span class\="corrected">hungry</span></span>, so I gave <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jer</span><span class\="corrected">her</span></span> some bread I <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jad</span><span class\="corrected">had</span></span> with me. She gobbled it up.<br>\nMaybe <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">javing</span><span class\="corrected">having</span></span> something to eat <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jelped</span><span class\="corrected">helped</span></span> <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jer</span><span class\="corrected">her</span></span> relax, because she fell right back asleep.<br>\nShe looked cold, so I went <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jome</span><span class\="corrected">home</span></span>, brought back a blanket and put it over <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jer</span><span class\="corrected">her</span></span>.<br>\nI ended up sleeping in the park too.<br>\nWhen I woke up, the little Warwolf was still asleep.<br>\nShe was clinging to me really tightly.<br>\nAfter a while, she woke up.<br>\nThe moment she opened <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jer</span><span class\="corrected">her</span></span> eyes, she was on guard.<br>\n<span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">Jer</span><span class\="corrected">Her</span></span> ears were sticking straight up.<br>\nI thought she might run away,<br>\nbut she kept gripping the blanket.<br>\n“Are you <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jungry</span><span class\="corrected">hungry</span></span>?”<br>\nI asked, and she nodded.
blog.section.3=I took <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jer</span><span class\="corrected">her</span></span> <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jome</span><span class\="corrected">home</span></span>.<br>\nThere was barely anything in the fridge then.<br>\nSo I tore up some bread and put it in soup.<br>\nThe little Warwolf ate like she'd never seen food before.<br>\nI still didn't know <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jer</span><span class\="corrected">her</span></span> name.<br>\nSo I asked,<br>\n“Do you <span class\="char-switch multi"><span class\="original">jave</span><span class\="corrected">have</span></span> a name?”<br>\nShe went quiet for a moment,<br>\nthen just said,<br>\n“Mei.”<br>\nAfter that, she fell asleep again.<br>\nShe seemed to feel safe.
blog.section.4=Oh, and why are there mistakes when I'm typing this? :忘却疑問符:<br>\nI'm using voice input.<br><br>\nThat's a bit of my past.<br>\nIf I get the chance, I'll write about some other stuff too. See you around.
